{"4643720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LITTLE MINER WORLD", "steam_appid": 4643720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643720/extras/c21444d5dd177dd70052a1c3c9ac2c1e.avif?t=1787230309\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643720/extras_big/c21444d5dd177dd70052a1c3c9ac2c1e.webp?t=1787230309 width=1560 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine, build, and explore! Start as a rookie and delve into the depths of the Mega-Mountain in this incremental mining adventure. Gather materials, construct buildings, and upgrade your miner to unravel the mystery hidden at the core and become the World’s Greatest Miner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your miner</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your days as a novice won't last long. Invest in a progression system that transforms your tools, techniques, and skills, unlocking new ways to dig faster, reach further, and face whatever awaits in the depths.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful tools and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master new mining techniques and technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve from humble novice to the World's Greatest Miner</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig into the depths</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mega-Mountain is a vast, layered world full of secrets waiting to be unearthed. Every level you reach hides new resources and ancient relics.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dozens of unique minerals and materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore increasingly dangerous and lucrative layers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden r